# Canonical author identities for git log / git blame / GitHub Contributors
# widget. See git-mailmap(5) for the format.
#
# The two "duplicate contributor" entries are the primary reason for this
# file: Bhavika Jain and Joachim Moortgat each committed under two different
# email addresses (a GitHub web-UI address and an institutional / HPC address);
# without this file the JOSS repository-analysis report counts each of them
# twice. The remaining lines just normalise the *display* name (e.g. commits
# tagged "amyhsu0" appear as "Hsiao Jou Hsu" in git log, matching the paper).

